    <content>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[{"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"4b83a788-622b-4210-afad-eac8988de0dd","key":"a2f10001-1001-4000-b001-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"backgroundColor","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":{"label":"","value":"#fff"}},{"alias":"backgroundOpacity","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":"1"},{"alias":"title","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":""}]},{"contentTypeKey":"7933a097-e795-4929-9746-d802b4ed8595","key":"a2f10001-2001-4000-b001-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"thumbnail","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":[]},{"alias":"description","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":"For developers, by developers"},{"alias":"title","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":"uTPro \u2013 Umbraco Turbo Pro"},{"alias":"content","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":{"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"be80a795-b398-4baa-860a-ee68b7124f11","key":"a2f10001-3001-4000-b001-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"richtext","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":{"blocks":{"contentData":[],"settingsData":[],"expose":[],"layout":{}},"markup":"\u003Ch2\u003EuTPro \u2013 Umbraco Turbo Pro\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFor developers, by developers\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EuTPro\u003C/strong\u003E is a powerful \u003Cstrong\u003EStarter Kit Template\u003C/strong\u003E built to \u003Cstrong\u003Eaccelerate website development on the Umbraco platform\u003C/strong\u003E. It enables developers to create \u003Cstrong\u003Eenterprise-grade websites\u003C/strong\u003E faster, more reliably, and with a professional structure from day one.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003ECore Principles\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmbraco Turbo Pro\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Speed up Umbraco development with a streamlined, production-ready foundation that ensures stability and scalability.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUniversal Template Project\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 A flexible, ready-to-use structure that adapts to multiple use cases: enterprise websites, product showcases, landing pages, and more.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUltimate Tech Productivity\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Reduce repetitive setup tasks, maximize efficiency, and let developers focus on delivering real value instead of boilerplate work.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EWhy uTPro?\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFast to start\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Launch projects in minutes with a clean, optimized base.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFlexible\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Easily customize to fit unique business or creative needs.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EScalable\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Built to support both small projects and enterprise-level solutions.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFree \u0026amp; Open Source\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 100% customizable, extendable, and community-driven.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EPerfect for\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECorporate websites and enterprise portals\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProduct landing pages and marketing campaigns\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeveloper teams who want a consistent, professional starting point\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAgencies looking to deliver faster without sacrificing quality\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EPre-installed Utilities\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDatabase flexibility\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Runs on PostgreSQL (default), SQL Server, or SQLite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModular startup\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Program.cs stays minimal; all configuration lives in Startup/*.cs extension methods.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMulti-layer caching\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Output Cache, browser stale-while-revalidate, immutable static assets, 7-day media uploads.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMinification \u0026amp; compression\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 CSS/JS via WebOptimizer, HTML via WebMarkupMin, Brotli/GZip/Deflate.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESEO-friendly meta setup\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Open Graph, Twitter Cards, JSON-LD, hreflang, canonical.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECore Web Vitals optimized\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Critical CSS inlined, LCP image preloaded, fonts preloaded, scripts lazy-loaded.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESecurity hardened\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Headers, HSTS, sync IO disabled, request limits, Data Protection key rotation.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECSS Design Tokens\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 All brand colors in variables.css; change one file to retheme entire site.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWCAG AA accessible\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Contrast-safe color system with CSS variable fallbacks.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESample components\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Navigation, footer, hero section, contact form ready to customize.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EModular Architecture\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECommon\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Shared models, constants, CMS-generated content models\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EExtension\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Reusable services (site context, culture management, URL helpers)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFoundation\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Infrastructure modules (middleware, favicon, sitemap, robots.txt)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFeature\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Optional pluggable features (form builder, file manager, audit log, backoffice dashboard)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EProject\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Main web application and configuration\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Ch3\u003ESecurity Built-in\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESecurity headers (X-Content-Type-Options, X-Frame-Options, HSTS, Referrer-Policy, Permissions-Policy)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESync IO disabled to prevent thread-pool starvation\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERequest size limits to prevent DoS\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDomain-based access control with wildcard support\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EData Protection keys with automatic 90-day rotation\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProper HTTP status codes for error pages (no soft-404s)\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003EuTPro is \u003Cstrong\u003Ecompletely free and open source\u003C/strong\u003E, giving developers the freedom to customize, extend, and innovate without limits.\u003C/p\u003E"}}]}],"settingsData":[],"expose":[{"contentKey":"a2f10001-3001-4000-b001-000000000001","culture":"en-US","segment":null}],"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockList":[{"contentKey":"a2f10001-3001-4000-b001-000000000001","contentUdi":null,"settingsKey":null,"settingsUdi":null}]}}}]}],"settingsData":[{"contentTypeKey":"d8c525b6-c39b-47f9-9e7e-6cc60eae7a17","key":"a2f10001-4001-4000-b001-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"addStyleSpacing","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":["Remove Spacing"]}]},{"contentTypeKey":"d8c525b6-c39b-47f9-9e7e-6cc60eae7a17","key":"a2f10001-5001-4000-b001-000000000001","values":[]}],"expose":[{"contentKey":"a2f10001-1001-4000-b001-000000000001","culture":"en-US","segment":null},{"contentKey":"a2f10001-2001-4000-b001-000000000001","culture":"en-US","segment":null}],"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockGrid":[{"areas":[{"items":[{"areas":[],"columnSpan":12,"contentKey":"a2f10001-2001-4000-b001-000000000001","contentUdi":null,"rowSpan":1,"settingsKey":"a2f10001-5001-4000-b001-000000000001","settingsUdi":null}],"key":"74341b8e-afe1-47c5-bd24-d94b157e8a1c"}],"columnSpan":12,"contentKey":"a2f10001-1001-4000-b001-000000000001","contentUdi":null,"rowSpan":1,"settingsKey":"a2f10001-4001-4000-b001-000000000001","settingsUdi":null}]}}]]></Value>
      <Value Culture="vi-VN"><![CDATA[{"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"4b83a788-622b-4210-afad-eac8988de0dd","key":"d1f10001-1001-4000-b001-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"backgroundColor","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":{"label":"","value":"#fff"}},{"alias":"backgroundOpacity","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":"1"},{"alias":"title","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":""}]},{"contentTypeKey":"7933a097-e795-4929-9746-d802b4ed8595","key":"d1f10001-2001-4000-b001-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"thumbnail","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":[]},{"alias":"description","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":"D\u00E0nh cho l\u1EADp tr\u00ECnh vi\u00EAn, b\u1EDFi l\u1EADp tr\u00ECnh vi\u00EAn"},{"alias":"title","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":"uTPro \u2013 Umbraco Turbo Pro"},{"alias":"content","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":{"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"be80a795-b398-4baa-860a-ee68b7124f11","key":"d1f10001-3001-4000-b001-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"richtext","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":{"blocks":{"contentData":[],"settingsData":[],"expose":[],"layout":{}},"markup":"\u003Ch2\u003EuTPro \u2013 Umbraco Turbo Pro\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ED\u00E0nh cho l\u1EADp tr\u00ECnh vi\u00EAn, b\u1EDFi l\u1EADp tr\u00ECnh vi\u00EAn\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EuTPro\u003C/strong\u003E l\u00E0 m\u1ED9t \u003Cstrong\u003EStarter Kit Template\u003C/strong\u003E m\u1EA1nh m\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c x\u00E2y d\u1EF1ng \u0111\u1EC3 \u003Cstrong\u003E\u0111\u1EA9y nhanh t\u1ED1c \u0111\u1ED9 ph\u00E1t tri\u1EC3n website tr\u00EAn n\u1EC1n t\u1EA3ng Umbraco\u003C/strong\u003E. Gi\u00FAp l\u1EADp tr\u00ECnh vi\u00EAn t\u1EA1o ra c\u00E1c trang web \u003Cstrong\u003Ec\u1EA5p doanh nghi\u1EC7p\u003C/strong\u003E nhanh h\u01A1n, \u0111\u00E1ng tin c\u1EADy h\u01A1n v\u1EDBi c\u1EA5u tr\u00FAc chuy\u00EAn nghi\u1EC7p ngay t\u1EEB \u0111\u1EA7u.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003ENguy\u00EAn l\u00FD C\u1ED1t l\u00F5i\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmbraco Turbo Pro\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 \u0110\u1EA9y nhanh ph\u00E1t tri\u1EC3n Umbraco v\u1EDBi n\u1EC1n t\u1EA3ng s\u1EB5n s\u00E0ng production.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUniversal Template Project\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 C\u1EA5u tr\u00FAc linh ho\u1EA1t, ph\u00F9 h\u1EE3p nhi\u1EC1u lo\u1EA1i d\u1EF1 \u00E1n.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUltimate Tech Productivity\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Gi\u1EA3m c\u00F4ng vi\u1EC7c l\u1EB7p l\u1EA1i, t\u1EADp trung v\u00E0o gi\u00E1 tr\u1ECB th\u1EF1c.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Ch3\u003ET\u1EA1i sao ch\u1ECDn uTPro?\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKh\u1EDFi \u0111\u1EA7u nhanh\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Tri\u1EC3n khai d\u1EF1 \u00E1n trong v\u00E0i ph\u00FAt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELinh ho\u1EA1t\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 D\u1EC5 d\u00E0ng t\u00F9y ch\u1EC9nh theo nhu c\u1EA7u.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EM\u1EDF r\u1ED9ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 H\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3 t\u1EEB d\u1EF1 \u00E1n nh\u1ECF \u0111\u1EBFn c\u1EA5p doanh nghi\u1EC7p.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMi\u1EC5n ph\u00ED \u0026amp; M\u00E3 ngu\u1ED3n m\u1EDF\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 100% t\u00F9y ch\u1EC9nh, c\u1ED9ng \u0111\u1ED3ng ph\u00E1t tri\u1EC3n.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EPh\u00F9 h\u1EE3p cho\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWebsite doanh nghi\u1EC7p v\u00E0 c\u1ED5ng th\u00F4ng tin\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELanding page s\u1EA3n ph\u1EA9m v\u00E0 chi\u1EBFn d\u1ECBch marketing\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u0110\u1ED9i ng\u0169 ph\u00E1t tri\u1EC3n c\u1EA7n \u0111i\u1EC3m kh\u1EDFi \u0111\u1EA7u chuy\u00EAn nghi\u1EC7p\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAgency mu\u1ED1n tri\u1EC3n khai nhanh m\u00E0 kh\u00F4ng gi\u1EA3m ch\u1EA5t l\u01B0\u1EE3ng\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Ch3\u003ETi\u1EC7n \u00EDch T\u00EDch h\u1EE3p s\u1EB5n\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDatabase linh ho\u1EA1t\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Ch\u1EA1y tr\u00EAn PostgreSQL (m\u1EB7c \u0111\u1ECBnh), SQL Server ho\u1EB7c SQLite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EStartup module h\u00F3a\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Program.cs t\u1ED1i gi\u1EA3n; c\u1EA5u h\u00ECnh n\u1EB1m trong Startup/*.cs.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECache \u0111a t\u1EA7ng\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Output Cache, stale-while-revalidate, static assets b\u1EA5t bi\u1EBFn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EN\u00E9n \u0026amp; t\u1ED1i \u01B0u\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 CSS/JS qua WebOptimizer, HTML qua WebMarkupMin, Brotli/GZip.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESEO-friendly\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Open Graph, Twitter Cards, JSON-LD, hreflang, canonical.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECore Web Vitals\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Critical CSS inline, LCP preload, fonts preload, lazy-load scripts.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EB\u1EA3o m\u1EADt\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Security headers, HSTS, request limits, Data Protection key rotation.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECSS Design Tokens\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 T\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 m\u00E0u s\u1EAFc trong variables.css.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWCAG AA\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 H\u1EC7 th\u1ED1ng m\u00E0u \u0111\u1EA3m b\u1EA3o contrast ratio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EComponents m\u1EABu\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Navigation, footer, hero, contact form s\u1EB5n s\u00E0ng.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EKi\u1EBFn tr\u00FAc Module\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECommon\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Models, constants, content types chung\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EExtension\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 D\u1ECBch v\u1EE5 t\u00E1i s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng (site context, culture, URL helpers)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFoundation\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 Module h\u1EA1 t\u1EA7ng (middleware, favicon, sitemap, robots.txt)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFeature\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 T\u00EDnh n\u0103ng t\u00F9y ch\u1ECDn (form builder, file manager, audit log, dashboard)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EProject\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 \u1EE8ng d\u1EE5ng web ch\u00EDnh v\u00E0 c\u1EA5u h\u00ECnh\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EB\u1EA3o m\u1EADt T\u00EDch h\u1EE3p\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESecurity headers (X-Content-Type-Options, X-Frame-Options, HSTS)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESync IO b\u1ECB t\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EC3 tr\u00E1nh thread-pool starvation\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGi\u1EDBi h\u1EA1n request size ch\u1ED1ng DoS\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKi\u1EC3m so\u00E1t domain v\u1EDBi wildcard\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EData Protection keys t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng xoay v\u00F2ng 90 ng\u00E0y\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHTTP status codes ch\u00EDnh x\u00E1c cho error pages\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003EuTPro \u003Cstrong\u003Eho\u00E0n to\u00E0n mi\u1EC5n ph\u00ED v\u00E0 m\u00E3 ngu\u1ED3n m\u1EDF\u003C/strong\u003E, mang l\u1EA1i quy\u1EC1n t\u1EF1 do t\u00F9y ch\u1EC9nh, m\u1EDF r\u1ED9ng v\u00E0 \u0111\u1ED5i m\u1EDBi s\u00E1ng t\u1EA1o kh\u00F4ng gi\u1EDBi h\u1EA1n.\u003C/p\u003E"}}]}],"settingsData":[],"expose":[{"contentKey":"d1f10001-3001-4000-b001-000000000001","culture":"vi-VN","segment":null}],"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockList":[{"contentKey":"d1f10001-3001-4000-b001-000000000001","contentUdi":null,"settingsKey":null,"settingsUdi":null}]}}}]}],"settingsData":[{"contentTypeKey":"d8c525b6-c39b-47f9-9e7e-6cc60eae7a17","key":"d1f10001-4001-4000-b001-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"addStyleSpacing","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":["Remove Spacing"]}]},{"contentTypeKey":"d8c525b6-c39b-47f9-9e7e-6cc60eae7a17","key":"d1f10001-5001-4000-b001-000000000001","values":[]}],"expose":[{"contentKey":"d1f10001-1001-4000-b001-000000000001","culture":"vi-VN","segment":null},{"contentKey":"d1f10001-2001-4000-b001-000000000001","culture":"vi-VN","segment":null}],"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockGrid":[{"areas":[{"items":[{"areas":[],"columnSpan":12,"contentKey":"d1f10001-2001-4000-b001-000000000001","contentUdi":null,"rowSpan":1,"settingsKey":"d1f10001-5001-4000-b001-000000000001","settingsUdi":null}],"key":"74341b8e-afe1-47c5-bd24-d94b157e8a1c"}],"columnSpan":12,"contentKey":"d1f10001-1001-4000-b001-000000000001","contentUdi":null,"rowSpan":1,"settingsKey":"d1f10001-4001-4000-b001-000000000001","settingsUdi":null}]}}]]></Value>
